-# House rules for getting into the seat: general admission, doors, latecomers.
-# The tone here is deliberately flat -- a house with a livelier policy (or a
-# different one) overrides this partial in its theme.
%h5 Seating and Admission
- unless order.performance.production.has_reserved_seating?
  %p
    All seating is general admission.
    - if theater_info.doors_open_minutes_before.present?
      = "Doors open #{pluralize(theater_info.doors_open_minutes_before, 'minute')} before curtain time."
    - if order.special_request.blank?
      - if theater_info.phone.present?
        = "If you have any special seating requests (wheelchair accessibility, stairs, etc.), please call us at #{theater_info.phone} and we'll do our best to make sure you're taken care of."
    - else
      We have your request for
      = order.special_request
      seating.  We will reserve those seats for you.
%p
  %i
    Please note that late seating is
    %b
      not
      = 'necessarily' if order.performance.production.allow_late_seating?
      available.
  Please make plans to be at the theater at least ten minutes before curtain.
